WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.850
Seventy-five hours, then a long quiet.

00:03.624 --> 00:12.676
Gene Cernan and Harrison Schmitt, the first scientist to walk on the Moon, stayed 75 hours and drove their rover about 36 km.

00:13.365 --> 00:19.750
After them robots landed three more times, and then nothing landed softly on the Moon for 37 years.
